					"content": "这是什么东西…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731040408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯万"
				},
				{
					"id": 731040408,
					"content": "这是…我，我来看看！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						731040409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荷贝特"
				},
				{
					"id": 731040409,
					"content": "就是这个！这是落水的文物之一！结构完好，也没有水生生物钻进去…",
